{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDAwLS0yMDEwL0tvbW9kbyUyMFZzJTIwQ29icmElMjAlMjgyMDA1JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"Komodo Vs Cobra","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/2dLwpe18MC3nIF5MmkWuB8waba9.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/a8ROQ0ATsV0y92D0kplsIqdXxCQ.jpg","description":"A team of environmentalists, including a reporter, her camera man, and an environmentalist's famous girlfriend charter a boat and with the captain, sail to a military island. They suspect the island is hosting to illegal activities. Upon arrival, however, they find no one. They finally reach a deserted house, where they find Dr. Susan Richardson, who tells them that everyone on the island is dead, including her father. Richardson's team were working on a compound that could make edible plants grow to super size, however the military intervened with plans of their own. They wanted to test the compound's effects on animals, and proceeded to feed it to several komodo dragons and cobras.\n\nReleased 19 Aug 2005 · United States of America · Language: English · 94 min\nStudio: CineTel Films\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2005","genres":["Horror","Science Fiction","TV Movie","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"4.1","imdb_id":"tt0455583","moviedb_id":28509,"tmdbId":28509,"runtime":"94 min","cast":["Michael Paré","Michelle Borth","Ryan McTavish","Renee Talbert","Jerri Manthey","Ted Monte","Glori-Anne Gilbert","Rene Rivera"],"director":["Jim Wynorski"],"writer":["Jim Wynorski","William Langlois"],"released":"2005-08-19T00:00:00.000Z","country":"United States of America","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Jim Wynorski","character":"Director","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/t0OGiUTL6vbFohfwI4dIUvoilSs.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Paré","character":"Capt. Michael A. Stoddard","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jxrXW8OL6hwJgtJgePdMO5yHuAM.jpg"},{"name":"Michelle Borth","character":"Dr. Susan Richard